462: State delta:
463: - Client-only (no route, repository, DB, Realtime lifecycle or sign-out change; no migration). 
`message-outbox.ts`: every create and fence runs through `withDeadline` and aborts at min(30 s, time left on the 45 s 
lease); an abort is `unknown`. `handleOnline` aborts this tab's in-flight requests, so an attempt started before or 
during an outage becomes unknown and is fenced and redispatched at generation+1 at once. 
`withDrainLock`/`drainLocked`/`holderLeaseEnded`: when the lock is busy and the oldest item is claimed by another tab 
whose lease ended, take the Web Lock with `steal: true`; the robbed tab flags itself and dispatches nothing more. 
BroadcastChannel `vo-messaging-outbox:<users.id>` announced after every outbox write; receivers re-read the 
conversation and schedule a drain check 2 s later (detects a closed holder). `render` keeps copies deleted as 
delivered elsewhere until the stored message is seen in this tab (fixes a no-bubble gap found by client-correlation). 
