18: /**
19:  * Phase 5 T12 — sign-out confirmation with unsent messages (FR-013, BR-008;
20:  * AC-013, AC-037 dialog clause, AC-047 "Sair mesmo" clause).
21:  *
22:  * Reachable in-app sign-out controls (enumerated at task start): one — the
23:  * account menu's "Sign out" (EnhancedUserMenu), rendered by the header of
24:  * every DashboardShell page (/floor-plan, /dashboard, /dashboard/profile,
25:  * /settings, /company). DashboardHeader's own signOut handler is not wired to
26:  * any control. The control is exercised from /floor-plan, /dashboard/profile
27:  * and /settings.
28:  *
29:  * Real accounts in the real UI; the IndexedDB outbox, the create/fence and
30:  * Presence logout routes, Supabase Auth and the local database are real.
31:  * Faults are network shaping (SPEC §15): requests failed in transit, a request
32:  * held in the browser, a real response held after pass-through and released
33:  * later, and the Presence logout request held in the browser for a moment.
34:  */
