codex
I found a stronger lease failure: Realtime can delete the claimed row while its tab still holds the Web Lock. If that 
tab freezes, the next waiting row has no lease for another tab to detect, so the conversation can remain stuck beyond 
the 45-second limit. I’m checking the remaining tests for coverage of this combination.

