16:    * stored message — e.g. a 204 or a malformed body): it may be stored, so the
17:    * item is kept and sent again.
18:    */
19:   | { kind: 'unknown'; status: number | null }
20:   /** 409 ATTEMPT_SUPERSEDED: a newer attempt of the key exists; ignored. */
21:   | { kind: 'superseded' }
22:   /** Definitive 4xx: no automatic retry (FR-007). */
23:   | { kind: 'failed'; status: number; reason: OutboxFailureReason }
24:   /** Fenced as not stored after its 24 h delivery window: never sent automatically (FR-009). */
25:   | { kind: 'expired' };
